<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- Wishes of speedy recovery for Uday Saddam Hussein after being subjected to cowardly and treacherous attack.</p>
<p>- Two oil tankers head for Mina al-Barkr on the Gulf.</p>
<p>- Israel continues with its blockade of West Bank.</p>
<p>- Pumping of Iraqi crude continues.</p>
<p>(The above were also carried by AL-IRAQ)</p>
